    "geometryObservation": "A bounded 100 m × 100 m GeoJSON response returned native IDs and polygon geometries. Four 50 m quadrant responses had an identical union of IDs and geometries, and the clicked parcel was included. The provider returned a few rows whose polygon geometries do not intersect the requested boxes; single-component multipolygons rule out disconnected parts as the explanation, so consumers must apply exact local geometry intersection filtering. A fresh exact-ID lookup returned the click geometry; a synthetic absent ID returned no records."
